      "raw": "<p>Because Constant Raiding causes damage after the power if finished. If a town/explorer comes back, does it die due to Military Response if there were dahan moved due to the power?</p>\r\n<p>E.g. Vigor moves two dahan into a land, then does two damage each, killing a city. The town returns into the land, does that:</p>\r\n<p>a. Die to the Constant Raiding</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; - or -</p>\r\n<p>b. Get returned after the movement is finished, avoiding the damage completely?</p>\r\n<p>I am leaning toward (b). Reason being that the movement is resolved part of the power. Thanks in advance.</p>",
